  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "2776-root",
    "title": "Simulation-based cataract surgery course",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Dr Aqdus Haq, an ophthalmology resident from Shifa International Hospital, Islamabad participated in our week-long simulation-based cataract surgery course on the Eyesi simulator. ",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "c7994e1f59835d26",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "2776-BannerImage.png",
        "src": "/news-media/2776-BannerImage.png",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Simulation-based cataract surgery course"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Aqdus Haq, an ophthalmology resident from Shifa International Hospital, Islamabad participated in our week-long simulation-based cataract surgery course on the Eyesi simulator. The course focused on using phacoemulsification for cataract removal. Faculty from the section of ophthalmology provided mentorship."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\"AKU CIME has provided a wonderful platform to learn phaco surgery in a safe environment and apply it in our surgical practice. I greatly enjoyed and learned a lot in this workshop, where all my surgical skills were polished. Practicing on simulator model along with proper guidance helped me in building up my hand eye coordination to perfecting every step of phacoemulsification. I would highly recommend this workshop to all residents for sharpening their surgical skills.\" - Dr Aqdus Haq, Ophthalmology Resident, Shifa International Hospital, Islamabad. "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
